    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/b573f24e55d6.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "shade",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/7f5bb03cf507.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "battery",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/3f3c58ae42b9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "clean",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/6a1cec45eaf3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "Leon is at the science museum.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/2ca48862b498.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "The city needs energy.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/f50c8439a0f3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "Energy makes things happen.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/86f21b6737a8.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "It can light a lamp and move a train.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/df149eb5f8fb.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "The sun shines again. Wind and water keep moving.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/a876dbd7aebe.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "They are renewable energy.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/089faed17036.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "Coal, oil, and gas form very slowly.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/da04877905f2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "They can run out.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/bf431cfd15cd.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "Leon finds a solar panel.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/12e254ab095b.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "It has many small solar cells.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/7cb615edc853.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "Sunlight hits the cells.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/7191271996e9.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "The cells make electricity.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/138816b7e12f.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "Electricity moves through wires.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/48514d0c214d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "Now the little lamp is on.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/7c626fb31133.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "Leon turns the panel toward the sun.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/d630eddd604c.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "It makes more power.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/00b02f497204.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "A tree makes shade.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/07145909381d.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "The panel makes less power.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/2ea586bb41a3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "Cloudy days still have some light.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/db98e9f44942.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "At night, the panel makes no power.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/bd535b89bf30.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "A battery can store energy for later.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/57d234b81198.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "Solar power, wind power, and water power can work together.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/2114bf9990de.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "The future city is bright and clean.",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/5979982b9e1e.mp3"
  },
  {
    "set": "shanghai-energy",
    "text": "Leon is an Energy Explorer!",
    "file": "assets/audio/shanghai-energy/bdb4c70159bc.mp3"
  }
]